WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.770
Your AI remembers your dog's name.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.370
But ask about your launch, and you get last month's date.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:14.090
And if you've used AI for a while, you're convinced: context makes it your own, and without it you get a mediocre result.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.570
So maybe you already use memory, and keep business knowledge in some of your working environments.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.870
Still, the day-to-day overwhelms you.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.150
Often you have to explain yourself, or fix AI's outdated idea of what's happening in your world.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.630
And in a dynamic company like monday.com, it's even worse.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:39.450
That's where a personal brain comes in: a context system built to serve one person, you.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:46.550
It taps into your systems and working processes, to help you hold a clear picture and manage your day-to-day.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.510
So in this adventure, you build yours and keep it current.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:54.300
You're done when your AI answers like a well-informed colleague.
